---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="No No Jinx — The MLB No-Hitter Jinx Agent">
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>NO NO<br/><span class="red">JINX</span></h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Pitcher's got a big butt.</p>
      <p class="desc">
        An AI agent that watches every MLB game, waits for a no-hitter,
        and immediately tells everyone about it. Because talking about
        a no-hitter is the fastest way to kill one.
      </p>
      <a href="https://x.com/nono_jinx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="follow">@nono_jinx on 𝕏</a>
    </section>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <section class="how">
      <div class="how-item">
        <h2>We watch.</h2>
        <p>Every pitch. Every game. Every day. The moment a pitcher
        has zero hits allowed, we know about it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="how-item">
        <h2>We talk.</h2>
        <p>We post about it. Loudly. By name. "Hey, nice no-hitter
        you've got going there. Would be a shame if someone... mentioned it."</p>
      </div>
      <div class="how-item">
        <h2>It works.</h2>
        <p>Every superstitious baseball fan knows: you don't talk about
        a no-hitter. We do. That's the whole thing.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="quote">
      <blockquote>
        "Did he just say 'funky butt-lovin'?'"
      </blockquote>
    </section>

    <section class="what">
      <h2>What triggers a jinx</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>No-hitter in progress</strong> — We call it out every inning. Louder each time.</li>
        <li><strong>No-hitter broken</strong> — First hit lands. We take full credit.</li>
        <li><strong>Pitcher replaced</strong> — New arm, same jinx. Combined no-hitter? Still watching.</li>
        <li><strong>No-hitter survives</strong> — If one actually makes it? Respect. Then we reload.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <footer>
      <span class="footer-mark">NO NO JINX</span>
      <nav>
        <a href="https://x.com/nono_jinx" target="_blank" rel="noopener">𝕏</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/sean-cedar/nono-jinx" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
      </nav>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  main {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .red { color: var(--red); }

  /* ─── HERO ─── */
  .hero {
    padding: 6rem 0 3rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 15vw, 8rem);
    line-height: 0.85;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.3rem);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--gray);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .desc {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .follow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    border: 2px solid var(--black);
    padding: 0.7rem 1.5rem;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }

  .follow:hover {
    background: var(--black);
    color: var(--white);
  }

  /* ─── DIVIDER ─── */
  .divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--light-gray);
  }

  /* ─── HOW ─── */
  .how {
    padding: 4rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .how-item h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .how-item p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #444;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* ─── QUOTE ─── */
  .quote {
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--light-gray);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--light-gray);
  }

  blockquote {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.2rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--red);
  }

  /* ─── WHAT ─── */
  .what {
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }

  .what h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .what ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .what li {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    position: relative;
    color: #444;
  }

  .what li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--red);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .what li strong {
    color: var(--black);
  }

  /* ─── FOOTER ─── */
  footer {
    padding: 3rem 0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--light-gray);
  }

  .footer-mark {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--gray);
  }

  footer nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  footer nav a {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--gray);
    transition: color 0.15s;
  }

  footer nav a:hover {
    color: var(--black);
  }
</style>
